Prakash walks to the new desk.
I walk with him.
"This is your desk, Maya," Prakash says.
I like this desk.
I put my bag on the desk.
I take the laptop from the bag.
I open the laptop.
"Do you have a mouse, Maya?" Prakash asks.
"Yes, I have a mouse," I say.
I take the mouse out of the bag.
"Do you have a charger?" he asks.
"Yes, I have a charger too," I reply.
"Do you have a pen?" Prakash asks.
"No, I do not have a pen," I say.
Prakash gives me a blue pen.
"Thank you," I say.
Now I have all the things.
I sit in the chair.
I start my work.
